{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Sun in the Shade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content: Visual Novel Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbAbout the Translation Patch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A volunteer has kindly created an English translation patch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please refer to the Community Hub.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis is because we cannot include external links on the store page.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bWe do not provide support for the translation patch here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSynopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High school student Hiroyuki Nasukawa, whose father is a piano tuner, aspires to become a respectable adult. Yet, plagued by anxieties about his future, he leads a troubled school life. His troubles culminate when he resorts to cheating on an exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsurprisingly, he gets caught. The punishment imposed on him is unexpectedly: \u201cPlease repair the school's piano.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame Overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is a linear, non-branching path, completing in about 1-2 hours. There are no character voices. A key feature is that illustrations progress almost entirely through still images, without using character portraits. (See product images)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRegarding Gameplay Videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to create them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2829210?t=1767105713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767105713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati